PDF Edit Web licensing gate

This Phase 0 feasibility slice is not yet cleared for public deployment.
MuPDF.js and its bundled WebAssembly binary are available under the
AGPL-3.0-or-later license or a commercial Artifex license. The project must
choose and document one of those paths before a production GitHub Pages
release. This notice does not grant a license to MuPDF.js.

Application source remains MIT-licensed only after the MuPDF licensing path,
source-distribution obligations, and third-party notices have been reviewed.
